es or accessories, and find your own style with the character customization feature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.poster.avif?t=1784534579\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.webm?t=1784534579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/04f6718b4c8573fdf3af95e0e356aa33.mp4?t=1784534579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a fairy tale, where your actions shape the story! Become a princess, navigate the murky political landscape, forge an alliance with the Fae, or turn your back on them. Make decisions that could save your kingdom, or destroy it if you misjudge the circumstances.", "supported_languages": "English, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, Polish, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/825c3ff5a3db2290fec4f9ac9be1bb2e73ddf07d/header.jpg?t=1784534579", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/514ea79e9c61930f78900ce733c325c986e8de89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784534579", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/514ea79e9c61930f78900ce733c325c986e8de89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784534579", "website": "https://elflockgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><stro